  "tips_letter_2_subtitle": "Adjust your language, level of formality, emotional tone, and details based on your relationship with the reader.",
  "tips_letter_2_title": "Considere o destinatário",
  "tips_letter_3_subtitle": "Choose a greeting that matches your relationship with the recipient and immediately establishes the right tone.",
  "tips_letter_3_title": "Comece adequadamente",
  "tips_letter_4_subtitle": "Organize your main points logically and avoid unnecessary details that distract from the purpose of the letter.",
  "tips_letter_4_title": "Mantenha a mensagem clara",
  "tips_letter_5_subtitle": "When appropriate, include sincere details, feelings, or specific memories that make the letter feel genuine.",
  "tips_letter_5_title": "Adicione um toque pessoal",
  "tips_letter_6_subtitle": "Finish with a closing that matches the tone and leaves the recipient with a clear final impression.",
  "tips_letter_6_title": "Termine adequadamente",
  "tips_letter_reminder": "The best letters feel intentional. Write for the person receiving the message and choose your tone based on your relationship.",
  "tips_letter_subtitle": "Write clear and thoughtful letters by matching your tone, structure, and message to the recipient and purpose.",
  "tips_letter_title": "Dicas para cartas",
  "tips_lyrics_1_subtitle": "Decide what your song is really about and keep verses, hooks, and emotional moments connected to that central idea.",
  "tips_lyrics_1_title": "Conheça o tema principal",
  "tips_lyrics_2_subtitle": "Create a memorable phrase or chorus that captures the central emotion and remains easy for listeners to remember.",
